      "writtenOn": "2018-07-19T12:00:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree Aaron\u0027s point.\nAnd we should dedicate at least 4 bytes magic numbers to indicate if bram is valid (offset 0x20 ~ 0x7f of BRAM_BANK0 are reserved).\n\nThe current version in this CL will have 1/256 probability to get a lot of reset causes at the first time during EC reset.",
